1
00:00:08,200 --> 00:00:12,700
打开，就能开始。
Open it and go.

2
00:00:13,200 --> 00:00:22,700
说一句话。它在做什么，你看得见。
Say it once. See what it's doing.

3
00:00:23,200 --> 00:00:29,700
动手之前，先问你一句。
It asks before it acts.

4
00:00:30,200 --> 00:00:39,700
离开 App，进度跟到灵动岛上。
Progress follows you to the Dynamic Island.

5
00:00:40,200 --> 00:00:47,700
锁屏上，也看得到它在办什么。
Right on your Lock Screen, too.

6
00:00:48,200 --> 00:00:52,700
确认之后，写进你的日历。
Confirmed, then on your calendar.

7
00:00:53,200 --> 00:00:59,700
提醒来了，一按完成，或稍后再说。
Done or snooze, right from the reminder.

8
00:01:00,200 --> 00:01:03,700
模型在标题栏里，随时可换。
Switch models from the title bar.

9
00:01:04,200 --> 00:01:08,700
记得你的偏好，也能随时删掉。
It remembers. You can forget.

10
00:01:13,200 --> 00:01:19,700
先你一步，把事办妥
A step ahead. Things handled.

